1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:02,280
We were never taught how to be angry,

2
00:00:02,300 --> 00:00:04,660
we were only taught how to hide it.

3
00:00:04,780 --> 00:00:06,240
In most Indian homes,

4
00:00:06,360 --> 00:00:08,020
anger had only one meaning which

5
00:00:08,040 --> 00:00:09,020
is disrespect.

6
00:00:09,450 --> 00:00:10,550
So raise your voice,

7
00:00:10,570 --> 00:00:11,070
you're rude.

8
00:00:11,090 --> 00:00:11,810
Push back,

9
00:00:11,830 --> 00:00:12,670
you're difficult.

10
00:00:12,710 --> 00:00:14,430
Say this hurt me to an elder,

11
00:00:14,590 --> 00:00:16,130
completely out of the question.

12
00:00:16,330 --> 00:00:18,310
So you learn very early to swallow

13
00:00:18,330 --> 00:00:20,270
your anger and convince yourself

14
00:00:20,290 --> 00:00:21,580
it wasn't a big deal.

15
00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:23,940
You got so good at it that you started

16
00:00:23,960 --> 00:00:25,110
calling it maturity.

17
00:00:25,130 --> 00:00:27,000
So the anger is not the problem.

18
00:00:27,020 --> 00:00:28,460
Anger is information.
